From 93c07a08c9a5197476af2bf5a1abae694c9b95d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shubhrajyoti Datta <shubhrajyoti.datta@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Jul 2025 12:22:26 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 005/190] clk: clocking-wizard: Fix the round rate handling for
 versal

commit 3f8cd035f6409463d674d0a33e94f37363ef00f7 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Fix the `clk_round_rate` implementation for Versal platforms by calling
the Versal-specific divider calculation helper. The existing code used
the generic divider routine, which results in incorrect round rate.

Fixes: 7681f64e6404 ("clk: clocking-wizard: calculate dividers fractional parts")
Signed-off-by: Shubhrajyoti Datta <shubhrajyoti.datta@amd.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20250625054114.28273-1-shubhrajyoti.datta@amd.com/
State: waiting
Message-ID: <6844c925609522ff1c04afd7c1a31158278daddc.1752820940.git.shubhrajyoti.datta@amd.com>
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/clk/xilinx/clk-xlnx-clock-wizard.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/xilinx/clk-xlnx-clock-wizard.c b/drivers/clk/xilinx/clk-xlnx-clock-wizard.c
index 4dd3dd0d4c9b..f209a02e8272 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/xilinx/clk-xlnx-clock-wizard.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/xilinx/clk-xlnx-clock-wizard.c
@@ -669,7 +669,7 @@ static long clk_wzrd_ver_round_rate_all(struct clk_hw *hw, unsigned long rate,
 	u32 m, d, o, div, f;
 	int err;
 
-	err = clk_wzrd_get_divisors(hw, rate, *prate);
+	err = clk_wzrd_get_divisors_ver(hw, rate, *prate);
 	if (err)
 		return err;
 
-- 
